  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Employment Capacity Building IDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Employment Capacity Building IDF aims to stregthen the capacity of the Ministry of Youth and Employment to effictively monitor and evaluate its employment programs.  This task is a follow-up on the recommendations of the recently finalized Senegal CEM on Employment (FY07).  The objective of the grant is to strengthen the M&amp;E capacity of the Ministry of Youth, Sports and Leisure (MYSL) to effectively plan, manage, and implement its youth employment programs. The grant will support (i) strengthening the ministry&apos;s M&amp;E framework; (ii) establishing a functional management information system for M&amp;E; (iii) an impact evaluation of the employment programs, and (iv) capacity development activities for M&amp;E.</narrative>
  </description>
